# Zetian, Celestial Empress

> Zetian is not a mage you pick to solo-carry from mid. She answers a specific draft problem: your team needs global reach, and the enemy composition punishes itself by clustering. Get the draft right and she wins teamfights from across the map; get it wrong and she is a paper target with no escape.

